&lt;p&gt;Gresham, Ore.&mdash; Detectives with the East County Major Crimes Team made two arrests in connection with yesterday&rsquo;s fatal shooting near W Powell Blvd. and Miller Ave.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Yesterday, shortly after 1:00 a.m., Gresham police officers responded to reports of gunfire and a person down in the parking lot of a fueling station. Officers located one person who was deceased of an apparent gunshot wound. The victim has been identified as Laquincy Fletcher, 48, of Gresham.&lt;/p&gt;

