&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos narrow,aptos narrow_embeddedfont,aptos narrow_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;The driver, and person who died, is identified as Francis Thomas Grice, Jr. Detectives do not believe there were any other people inside the pickup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos narrow,aptos narrow_embeddedfont,aptos narrow_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
