&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW259907531 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;The Benton County Sheriff&rsquo;s Office and Benton County Public Works are monitoring conditions, coordinating response plans and preparing crews and equipment to address flooding and road impacts as needed.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
