&lt;p style="margin-left:9.0pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left: 9pt; text-align: center;"&gt;###&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Beginning on December 18, 2025, the Lincoln County Jail will now offer access to video visitation in the lobby. The addition of video visitation access in the lobby allows those individuals who do not have internet, or access to a smartphone to video visit adults in custody. The lobby kiosk is an extension of our long-standing video visitation service provided by Turnkey Corrections. Video visitation fees are charged at a per minute rate.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Established visitors can use the lobby kiosk to log directly into their existing account, while new users can create an account onsite.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Lobby visitation is available daily from 9:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. Adult in custody availability may vary based on housing location and scheduling.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW144044710 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;OREGON CITY -&amp;nbsp;The Clackamas Community College Board of Education appointed Milwaukie resident Alina&amp;nbsp;Krollenbrock&amp;nbsp;to the board during its Dec. 17 meeting.&amp;nbsp;Krollenbrock&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;represent&amp;nbsp;Zone&amp;nbsp;1,&amp;nbsp;Milwaukie, filling the seat previously held by&amp;nbsp;Kathy Hyzy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW144044710 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;Krollenbrock&amp;nbsp;is a postdoctoral research fellow at Providence Cancer Institute.&amp;nbsp;She holds a doctorate in physiology and pharmacology from Oregon Health and Science University and degrees in chemistry from Reed College and Northeastern University.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW144044710 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;Her scientific background encompasses a broad set of disciplines, ranging from plant&amp;nbsp;biology to nuclear reactor operation. Her research projects in medicinal chemistry included creating&amp;nbsp;molecular tools for the early detection of Alzheimer&rsquo;s disease, testing novel therapeutics for cancer, and&amp;nbsp;discovering&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;new class of antimalarial drugs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW144044710 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;Krollenbrock&amp;nbsp;is passionate about public education and community service.&amp;nbsp;She volunteered for the Science Club of Girls, providing after-school activities. She also won an award for her teaching as a teaching assistant&amp;nbsp;at Northeastern University and was involved in student&amp;nbsp;leadership at&amp;nbsp;OHSU.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW144044710 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&ldquo;With skyrocketing tuition costs at four-year&amp;nbsp;colleges and universities, I worry that the education that supports my livelihood is increasingly&amp;nbsp;out of reach for members of my community. CCC forms a vital bridge between community&amp;nbsp;members and their academic goals,&rdquo;&amp;nbsp;Krollenbrock&amp;nbsp;said. &ldquo;In a climate of tight budgets and&amp;nbsp;difficult decisions&amp;nbsp;at the state&amp;nbsp;and national level, I want to do my part to advocate on behalf of CCC to&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;access to&amp;nbsp;education for all.&rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW144044710 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&ldquo;We are excited to welcome Dr.&amp;nbsp;Krollenbrock&amp;nbsp;to the CCC Board of Education. Her background in science,&amp;nbsp;education&amp;nbsp;and public service brings a valuable perspective to the board. I look forward to working with her to support student success and community connections,&rdquo; CCC&amp;nbsp;President&amp;nbsp;Tim Cook said.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW144044710 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;Krollenbrock&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;lives with her wife and two children, as well as two&amp;nbsp;dogs&amp;nbsp;and three cats.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW144044710 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;She&amp;nbsp;will hold office until June 30, 2027, and will be eligible to run in the May 2027 election.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:windowtext; font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

