&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Recreation&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For public safety, all county forest roads, trails, and parks are closed to the public due to hazardous conditions such as downed trees, washed-out roads, and landslides. Please stay clear of these areas to allow our crews to work safely on storm recovery efforts. Signage may or may not be in place alerting of this closure.&lt;/p&gt;

