&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Winds are anticipated to move north up the Willamette Valley, arriving in Corvallis about 9 a.m. We will provide an updated forecast from the National Weather Service after 9:30 a.m.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

